"If Jenkins is already deploying, why do you need Argo CD?"

Say:

"In our setup, Jenkins handled the CI activities such as build, test, code-quality checks, security scanning, and image publishing to ECR. Argo CD handled the Kubernetes deployment part using GitOps. So we separated CI and CD responsibilities."
